{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7v4dn7u3","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":39,"title":"Wo ist der Aufzug?","nativeTitle":"Where Is the Elevator?","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Nico","Mitarbeiter","Max","Lisa"],"speakerGenders":{"Nico":"male","Mitarbeiter":"male","Max":"male","Lisa":"female"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Hallo, guten Tag. Ich suche Lisa Brunner.","native":"Hello, good day. I'm looking for Lisa Brunner."},{"speaker":"Mitarbeiter","target":"Entschuldigung, wen suchen Sie?","native":"Excuse me, who are you looking for?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Lisa Brunner.","native":"Lisa Brunner."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Hallo, Max Stöpel mein Name. Wir suchen eine Lisa Brunner. Sie hat hier um vierzehn Uhr ein Bewerbungsgespräch .","native":"Hello, my name is Max Stöpel. We're looking for a Lisa Brunner. She has a job interview here at fourteen hundred."},{"speaker":"Mitarbeiter","target":"Also, die Bewerbungsgespräche finden normalerweise im Besprechungsraum statt .","native":"Well, job interviews usually take place in the meeting room."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Wo finden wir den Besprechungsraum?","native":"Where do we find the meeting room?"},{"speaker":"Mitarbeiter","target":"In der dritten Etage . Aber nein, warten Sie! Ich glaube, heute finden die Bewerbungsgespräche in der vierten Etage neben der Kantine statt.","native":"On the third floor. But no, wait! I think today the job interviews are taking place on the fourth floor next to the cafeteria."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Aha.","native":"I see."},{"speaker":"Mitarbeiter","target":"Sie nehmen den Aufzug, fahren in die vierte Etage. Da gehen Sie links , dann rechts und wieder links. Der Besprechungsraum ist rechts. Zimmer 431.","native":"You take the elevator up to the fourth floor. There you go left, then right and left again. The meeting room is on the right. Room 431."},{"speaker":"Max","targ